                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "I'm a ban—I'm a bandito",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "In City, I feel my spirit is contained",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Like neon inside the glass, they form my brain",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "But I recently discovered it's a heatless fire",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Like nicknames they give themselves to uninspire",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Begin with bullet, now add fire to the proof",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "But I'm still not sure if fear's a rival or close relative to truth",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Either way it helps to hear these words bounce off of you",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "The softest echo could be enough for me to make it through",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_4",
            "type": "bridge",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Folina, Sahlo Folina",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Sahlo Folina, Sahlo Folina",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "I created this world to feel some control",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Destroy it if I want",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "So I sing Sahlo Folina, Sahlo Folina, Sahlo",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
